  "implementation": "One typed canonical_retry transition handles the existing classified CMG numerical and frozen-linear failure reasons. CMG records failure evidence, retires its ordinary owner and refreshes the stale accepted frame; frozen failure invalidates its retained state. One fresh solve/certificate, count/inner accounting, MAP observation and candidate extraction sequence replaces the duplicates. Only frozen retry completes a pending allocation-equivalence audit as false, after extraction.",
